{"items":[{"t":"C","n":"TCPDF","p":"TCPDF.html","d":"","f":{"n":"[Global Namespace]","p":"[Global_Namespace].html"}},{"t":"C","n":"TCPDF_ENGINE","p":"TCPDF_ENGINE.html","d":"","f":{"n":"[Global Namespace]","p":"[Global_Namespace].html"}},{"t":"M","n":"TCPDF::__construct","p":"TCPDF.html#method___construct","d":null},{"t":"M","n":"TCPDF::__destruct","p":"TCPDF.html#method___destruct","d":null},{"t":"M","n":"TCPDF::__get","p":"TCPDF.html#method___get","d":"<p>Legacy protected properties historically read by TCPDF subclasses\n(e.g. $this-&gt;AutoPageBreak, $this-&gt;lMargin), mapped to facade state.</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"TCPDF::__isset","p":"TCPDF.html#method___isset","d":""},{"t":"M","n":"TCPDF::engineInit","p":"TCPDF.html#method_engineInit","d":"<p>Create (or re-create) the tc-lib-pdf engine for the given unit.</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"TCPDF::ambientPageContent","p":"TCPDF.html#method_ambientPageContent","d":"<p>Raw PDF operators for the ambient text state that must open every page\ncontent stream: the engine re-emits the current font (carrying its\nspacing/stretching) when it adds a page, so the facade only needs to\ncarry the legacy text color across page breaks.</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"TCPDF::fileAllowedPaths","p":"TCPDF.html#method_fileAllowedPaths","d":"<p>Local paths the engine may read files from. The legacy API loaded\nimages and fonts from application-relative locations, so in addition\nto the engine defaults this allows the configured TCPDF paths, the\ncurrent working directory and the running script directory.</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"TCPDF::fileOptions","p":"TCPDF.html#method_fileOptions","d":"<p>Assemble the file-access options handed to the engine's shared file\nhelper (tc-lib-file). These drive the upstream security sandbox that\ngoverns which local paths and remote hosts external resources (images,\nfonts, SVG, ...) may be loaded from.</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"TCPDF::engine","p":"TCPDF.html#method_engine","d":"<p>Return the engine instance.</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"TCPDF::emitToPage","p":"TCPDF.html#method_emitToPage","d":"<p>Append raw PDF content to the current page (no-op when no page exists).</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"TCPDF::normalizeOrientation","p":"TCPDF.html#method_normalizeOrientation","d":"<p>Normalize a legacy orientation value to 'P' or 'L'.</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"TCPDF::normalizePdfaMode","p":"TCPDF.html#method_normalizePdfaMode","d":"<p>Map the legacy $pdfa constructor flag onto an engine conformance mode.</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"TCPDF::buildPageData","p":"TCPDF.html#method_buildPageData","d":"<p>Build the engine page data array for a new page.</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"TCPDF::colorSpecFromLegacy","p":"TCPDF.html#method_colorSpecFromLegacy","d":"<p>Convert a legacy color definition (component list or array) to an\nengine color specification string.</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"TCPDF::colorSpecFromComponents","p":"TCPDF.html#method_colorSpecFromComponents","d":"<p>Convert legacy color components (setColor-style) to a spec string.</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"TCPDF::legacyColorComponents","p":"TCPDF.html#method_legacyColorComponents","d":"<p>Sanitize a legacy color component array (numbers, optional spot name).</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"TCPDF::currentLineStyle","p":"TCPDF.html#method_currentLineStyle","d":"<p>Current line style as an engine style array (lineWidth, lineColor, ...).</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"TCPDF::stylesFromLegacyBorder","p":"TCPDF.html#method_stylesFromLegacyBorder","d":"<p>Build the engine per-side styles array from a legacy border argument.</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"TCPDF::legacyBorderCellMetrics","p":"TCPDF.html#method_legacyBorderCellMetrics","d":"<p>Mirror legacy adjustCellPadding(): a cell border reserves a minimum cell\npadding so the stroke does not overlap the text, and the optional\nposition mode decides how much of the stroke falls inside the cell box:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>ext    : the whole stroke is painted outside  -&gt; 0 padding, the\nborder rectangle grows outward;</li>\n<li>int    : the whole stroke is painted inside     -&gt; a full line-width\npadding, the border rectangle shrinks inward;</li>\n<li>normal : the stroke straddles the edge          -&gt; half line-width.</li>\n</ul>"},{"t":"M","n":"TCPDF::styleFromLegacyLineStyle","p":"TCPDF.html#method_styleFromLegacyLineStyle","d":"<p>Convert a legacy line style array (width, cap, join, dash, phase, color)\nto an engine style array.</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"TCPDF::shapeModeFromLegacy","p":"TCPDF.html#method_shapeModeFromLegacy","d":"<p>Map a legacy shape style letter combination to an engine paint mode.</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"TCPDF::shapeStyleFromLegacy","p":"TCPDF.html#method_shapeStyleFromLegacy","d":"<p>Build the engine style for a legacy (line_style, fill_color) pair.</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"TCPDF::segmentStylesFromLegacy","p":"TCPDF.html#method_segmentStylesFromLegacy","d":"<p>Convert a legacy per-segment/per-side style list to engine styles.</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"TCPDF::coordOrCursor","p":"TCPDF.html#method_coordOrCursor","d":"<p>Resolve a legacy optional coordinate ('' or null means current position).</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"TCPDF::completeSideStyles","p":"TCPDF.html#method_completeSideStyles","d":"<p>Complete partial per-side styles with the current graph style defaults\n(the engine HTML renderer requires fully-populated style arrays).</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"TCPDF::canBreakPage","p":"TCPDF.html#method_canBreakPage","d":"<p>Whether the content can be moved to another column or page when it does\nnot fit below the current position.</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"TCPDF::breakIfNeeded","p":"TCPDF.html#method_breakIfNeeded","d":"<p>Trigger an automatic page break when the given height does not fit.</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"TCPDF::advanceToNextColumn","p":"TCPDF.html#method_advanceToNextColumn","d":"<p>Move the cursor to the top of the next column, when column mode is\nactive and the current column is not the last one.</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"TCPDF::advanceToNextPage","p":"TCPDF.html#method_advanceToNextPage","d":"<p>Move to the top of the next page for an automatic break, reusing an\nalready-created page when one exists.</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"TCPDF::valignToEngine","p":"TCPDF.html#method_valignToEngine","d":"<p>Map a legacy text vertical alignment letter to the engine convention.</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"TCPDF::cellCalignShift","p":"TCPDF.html#method_cellCalignShift","d":"<p>Legacy $calign cell vertical alignment: the amount (user units) by which\nthe cell box top is shifted UP relative to the current text line. The\nfont-relative modes (A/L/D) depend on $valign, mirroring getCellCode().</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"TCPDF::halignToEngine","p":"TCPDF.html#method_halignToEngine","d":"<p>Map a legacy horizontal alignment letter to the engine convention.</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"TCPDF::engineOutlines","p":"TCPDF.html#method_engineOutlines","d":"<p>Bookmark outline entries collected by the engine.</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"TCPDF::setEngineOutlines","p":"TCPDF.html#method_setEngineOutlines","d":"<p>Replace the engine bookmark outline entries (used to remap page\ntargets after the TOC pages are relocated).</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"TCPDF::applyHtmlTextShadow","p":"TCPDF.html#method_applyHtmlTextShadow","d":"<p>Emulate the legacy text shadow for engine-rendered HTML content.</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"TCPDF::pageContentImageBottom","p":"TCPDF.html#method_pageContentImageBottom","d":"<p>Lowest bottom edge (user units from the page top) of the images\nplaced in the content chunks appended after the given index.</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"TCPDF::pageContentCount","p":"TCPDF.html#method_pageContentCount","d":"<p>Number of raw content chunks of the given engine page.</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"TCPDF::movePageContentToFront","p":"TCPDF.html#method_movePageContentToFront","d":"<p>Move the content chunks appended after the given index to the front\nof the page stream, so they paint <em>behind</em> the page body. Used for\ndeferred header rendering: the legacy engine painted headers at\npage-start time, i.e. under the body content.</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"TCPDF::cellBBoxCount","p":"TCPDF.html#method_cellBBoxCount","d":"<p>Number of entries currently on the engine cell bounding-box stack.</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"TCPDF::cellBBoxBottomSince","p":"TCPDF.html#method_cellBBoxBottomSince","d":"<p>Lowest bottom edge (user units) among the cell bounding boxes pushed\non the engine stack after the given index.</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"TCPDF::cellBoxOutput","p":"TCPDF.html#method_cellBoxOutput","d":"<p>PDF code for a cell background fill and the requested border sides.</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"TCPDF::drawHtmlCellSegments","p":"TCPDF.html#method_drawHtmlCellSegments","d":"<p>Draw the per-page border/fill segments of an auto-height HTML cell\nthat flowed across pages (the engine skips the cell box in that case).</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"TCPDF::insertPageContent","p":"TCPDF.html#method_insertPageContent","d":"<p>Insert a PDF content chunk at the given position of an engine page\ncontent stream, so it paints behind the chunks that follow it.</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"TCPDF::stretchedCellText","p":"TCPDF.html#method_stretchedCellText","d":"<p>PDF code for a stretched cell text run (legacy Cell stretch modes).</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"TCPDF::refreshFontState","p":"TCPDF.html#method_refreshFontState","d":"<p>Re-apply the current font to the engine font stack so it carries the\nup-to-date spacing/stretching.</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"TCPDF::naturalOrdWidth","p":"TCPDF.html#method_naturalOrdWidth","d":"<p>Raw PDF code that renders the current font's natural (unstretched,\nunspaced) measurement of the given text width in user units.</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"TCPDF::engineShadow","p":"TCPDF.html#method_engineShadow","d":"<p>Current engine text shadow array (or null when disabled).</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"TCPDF::forcedTextDir","p":"TCPDF.html#method_forcedTextDir","d":"<p>Forced text direction for the engine ('' = inherit document direction).</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"TCPDF::resolveLocalFile","p":"TCPDF.html#method_resolveLocalFile","d":"<p>Canonicalize a local file path before handing it to the engine.</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"TCPDF::attachLink","p":"TCPDF.html#method_attachLink","d":"<p>Register an external link annotation for the given rectangle.</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"TCPDF::decorateAllPages","p":"TCPDF.html#method_decorateAllPages","d":"<p>Render the deferred page decorations (headers and footers) on every\npage. Called once when the document is closed: at that time the total\npage count is known, so the default footer can print real numbers.</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"TCPDF::setPageUnit","p":"TCPDF.html#method_setPageUnit","d":null},{"t":"M","n":"TCPDF::setPageOrientation","p":"TCPDF.html#method_setPageOrientation","d":null},{"t":"M","n":"TCPDF::setSpacesRE","p":"TCPDF.html#method_setSpacesRE","d":null},{"t":"M","n":"TCPDF::setRTL","p":"TCPDF.html#method_setRTL","d":null},{"t":"M","n":"TCPDF::getRTL","p":"TCPDF.html#method_getRTL","d":""},{"t":"M","n":"TCPDF::setTempRTL","p":"TCPDF.html#method_setTempRTL","d":null},{"t":"M","n":"TCPDF::isRTLTextDir","p":"TCPDF.html#method_isRTLTextDir","d":""},{"t":"M","n":"TCPDF::setLastH","p":"TCPDF.html#method_setLastH","d":null},{"t":"M","n":"TCPDF::getCellHeight","p":"TCPDF.html#method_getCellHeight","d":"<p>Return the cell height for the given font size.</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"TCPDF::resetLastH","p":"TCPDF.html#method_resetLastH","d":null},{"t":"M","n":"TCPDF::getLastH","p":"TCPDF.html#method_getLastH","d":""},{"t":"M","n":"TCPDF::setImageScale","p":"TCPDF.html#method_setImageScale","d":null},{"t":"M","n":"TCPDF::getImageScale","p":"TCPDF.html#method_getImageScale","d":""},{"t":"M","n":"TCPDF::getPageDimensions","p":"TCPDF.html#method_getPageDimensions","d":null},{"t":"M","n":"TCPDF::getPageWidth","p":"TCPDF.html#method_getPageWidth","d":"<p>Return the page width in user units.</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"TCPDF::getPageHeight","p":"TCPDF.html#method_getPageHeight","d":"<p>Return the page height in user units.</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"TCPDF::getBreakMargin","p":"TCPDF.html#method_getBreakMargin","d":"<p>Return the automatic page-break bottom margin.</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"TCPDF::getScaleFactor","p":"TCPDF.html#method_getScaleFactor","d":""},{"t":"M","n":"TCPDF::setMargins","p":"TCPDF.html#method_setMargins","d":null},{"t":"M","n":"TCPDF::setLeftMargin","p":"TCPDF.html#method_setLeftMargin","d":null},{"t":"M","n":"TCPDF::setTopMargin","p":"TCPDF.html#method_setTopMargin","d":null},{"t":"M","n":"TCPDF::setRightMargin","p":"TCPDF.html#method_setRightMargin","d":null},{"t":"M","n":"TCPDF::setCellPadding","p":"TCPDF.html#method_setCellPadding","d":null},{"t":"M","n":"TCPDF::setCellPaddings","p":"TCPDF.html#method_setCellPaddings","d":null},{"t":"M","n":"TCPDF::getCellPaddings","p":"TCPDF.html#method_getCellPaddings","d":""},{"t":"M","n":"TCPDF::setCellMargins","p":"TCPDF.html#method_setCellMargins","d":null},{"t":"M","n":"TCPDF::getCellMargins","p":"TCPDF.html#method_getCellMargins","d":""},{"t":"M","n":"TCPDF::setAutoPageBreak","p":"TCPDF.html#method_setAutoPageBreak","d":null},{"t":"M","n":"TCPDF::getAutoPageBreak","p":"TCPDF.html#method_getAutoPageBreak","d":""},{"t":"M","n":"TCPDF::setDisplayMode","p":"TCPDF.html#method_setDisplayMode","d":null},{"t":"M","n":"TCPDF::setCompression","p":"TCPDF.html#method_setCompression","d":null},{"t":"M","n":"TCPDF::setSRGBmode","p":"TCPDF.html#method_setSRGBmode","d":null},{"t":"M","n":"TCPDF::setDocInfoUnicode","p":"TCPDF.html#method_setDocInfoUnicode","d":null},{"t":"M","n":"TCPDF::setTitle","p":"TCPDF.html#method_setTitle","d":null},{"t":"M","n":"TCPDF::setSubject","p":"TCPDF.html#method_setSubject","d":null},{"t":"M","n":"TCPDF::setAuthor","p":"TCPDF.html#method_setAuthor","d":null},{"t":"M","n":"TCPDF::setKeywords","p":"TCPDF.html#method_setKeywords","d":null},{"t":"M","n":"TCPDF::setCreator","p":"TCPDF.html#method_setCreator","d":null},{"t":"M","n":"TCPDF::setAllowLocalFiles","p":"TCPDF.html#method_setAllowLocalFiles","d":null},{"t":"M","n":"TCPDF::Error","p":"TCPDF.html#method_Error","d":null},{"t":"M","n":"TCPDF::Open","p":"TCPDF.html#method_Open","d":null},{"t":"M","n":"TCPDF::Close","p":"TCPDF.html#method_Close","d":null},{"t":"M","n